react-native-fast-tflite-nitro-v1

This is a port of react-native-fast-tflite 3.0.1 to Nitro Modules V1.
react-native-fast-tflite is Copyright (c) 2023 Marc Rousavy and is MIT
licensed; see LICENSE. The upstream project is
https://github.com/mrousavy/react-native-fast-tflite.

The port keeps that license. Changes from 3.0.1 are recorded in this
repository's git history, starting after upstream tag v3.0.1 (51fa54a).

Third-party binaries

This repository contains no TensorFlow code or binaries. The build fetches
them:

- iOS: Package.swift downloads the TensorFlowLiteC and TensorFlowLiteCCoreML
  2.17.0 xcframeworks from the tensorflowlitec-2.17.0 release of this
  repository:
  https://github.com/mikevocalz/react-native-fast-tflite-nitro-v1/releases/tag/tensorflowlitec-2.17.0
  They hold the static archives and headers from Google's TensorFlowLiteC
  2.17.0 pod, repackaged as static-library xcframeworks without recompiling
  (scripts/repack-tflite-xcframeworks.sh), and are licensed under the Apache
  License 2.0. That release also carries the TensorFlow LICENSE (from tag
  v2.17.0) and a NOTICE describing their source.

- Android: android/build.gradle resolves com.google.ai.edge.litert:litert and
  com.google.ai.edge.litert:litert-gpu 1.4.0 from Maven Central. LiteRT is
  Copyright Google LLC and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
